op7t-0200: the sandbox container-path stand-in fails when there is no container

2026-11-12: Safari stays black ~25 s before a page shows; the watchdog then
killed MobileSafari (0x8badf00d) with its main thread in CloudTabStore
dispatch_sync, waiting on iCloud tabs / the key-value store. Meanwhile
com.apple.Safari.History and syncdefaultsd abort every ~10 s:
  -[NSURL initFileURLWithPath:isDirectory:]: nil string parameter
from SafariCore -[NSFileManager _safari_getMobileSafariContainerDirectoryURL:
isContainerized:], which (disassembled on the phone) calls
sandbox_container_path_for_pid(getpid(), buf, 1024) and, on success, builds
the URL from buf; on failure it asks LaunchServices instead.

0177's stand-in (Sandbox op 4) returned 0 without writing anything for every
process with no CFFIXED_USER_HOME (daemons, XPC services: not containerized)
and on its early exits. Now ENOENT unless a path was copied out, as the real
sandbox fails for uncontainerized processes. Containerized apps (0177's
PlugInKit / file picker case) still get their path.

Apply after 0199.
---
diff --git a/bsd/kern/sweet_amfi.c b/bsd/kern/sweet_amfi.c
index 2fa42da..76e8ecc 100644
--- a/bsd/kern/sweet_amfi.c
+++ b/bsd/kern/sweet_amfi.c
@@ -365,7 +365,7 @@ sweet_sandbox_container_path(user_addr_t arg)
 	task = proc_task(p);
 	if (user_stack == 0 || argslen == 0 || task == TASK_NULL) {
 		proc_rele(p);
-		return 0;
+		return ENOENT;                  /* 0200: no container known (was 0 = "success", nothing written) */
 	}
 	/* as sysctl_procargsx(): the task keeps the map alive once the process is let go */
 	task_reference(task);
@@ -373,7 +373,7 @@ sweet_sandbox_container_path(user_addr_t arg)
 	map = get_task_map_reference(task);
 	task_deallocate(task);
 	if (map == VM_MAP_NULL) {
-		return 0;
+		return ENOENT;
 	}
 	strings_size = vm_map_round_page(argslen, vm_map_page_mask(map));
 	if (kmem_alloc(kernel_map, &strings, strings_size, KMA_DATA | KMA_ZERO, VM_KERN_MEMORY_BSD) != KERN_SUCCESS) {
@@ -389,8 +389,15 @@ sweet_sandbox_container_path(user_addr_t arg)
 			vm_map_copy_discard(copy);
 		}
 		kmem_free(kernel_map, strings, strings_size);
-		return 0;                       /* on its way out, or its stack unmapped */
+		return ENOENT;                  /* on its way out, or its stack unmapped */
 	}
+	/*
+	 * 0200: no CFFIXED_USER_HOME = not containerized: fail as the real sandbox does. Returning 0 with nothing
+	 * written made SafariCore (_safari_getMobileSafariContainerDirectoryURL) build a URL from an empty path ->
+	 * "-[NSURL initFileURLWithPath:isDirectory:]: nil string": com.apple.Safari.History and syncdefaultsd
+	 * crash-looped, and MobileSafari's main thread waited on them (CloudTabStore, 2026-11-12).
+	 */
+	error = ENOENT;
 	end = (const char *)(strings + strings_size);
 	for (s = end - argslen; s < end; s += len + 1) {
 		len = strnlen(s, (size_t)(end - s));
